Z||000011||Patrick||09-02-99||05:17 PM||||<br>Hello, my name is Patrick and I am a Fieroholic. My problem began in the fall of ‘83 when I came across a brand new 1984 Fiero in the motel parking lot where I was staying, somewhere in the south-western States. The vehicle option/prices paperwork was still stuck to the window. I knew then that I wanted a Fiero. It took me 13 ½ years, but I finally got one in January of ‘97, a 1987 2.5L 5-speed coupe. My life has not been the same since. I used to have friends. I used to go out. Now I stay home, alone, fixing my Fiero. You people are my only contact with the outside world. I'm so lonely....<p>Oh, I'm a property manager, 43 years old, single (go figure, eh) and live in Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada.<p>
