Z||000047||yellowFormula||09-04-99||07:39 PM||||I couldn't resist posting here!<p>My name is Jeff, I live in Baltimore MD (sometimes I think I am the only Fiero enthusiast here) I am 17, and my story is when I was 15 my sisters boyfriend bought a mint 84 Sport Coupe, and I loved it. Then I started researching them on the internet and I decided I wanted a Formula. Mainly 88 GT's are too expensive, and I didn't want to put money in a suspension kit to make a pre-88 handle like I wanted (or better), so after a year and a half of searching for the formula that met my criteria of being in the state of MD, under $4,000, and a 5 speed I finally found one for dirt cheap from a rich guy who didnt take care of it and since then I bought 2 beat up coupes, a '88 and a '87, which my sister drives currently. <p>sorry if this was too long!<br>Jeff<br>http://members.aol.com/Fiero5sp   
