Z||000066||Cliff D.||09-08-1999||09:37 PM||||I am a 34 year old audio engineer in the Washington D.C. area. Did you see the see the tribute at the Capitol building for the cops that got killed? I was the one mixing the sound for the media feed. I guess I take it for granted that I get to meet some celebrities because I felt like an idiot asking Garth Brooks to pose with me for a picture for my wife. I am the proud owner of a new race team consisting of a gutted 85 GT with a gaping hole in the intake and a burned up clutch, and a Ford F-250 tow vihicle which currently is on two front wheels and 2 jackstands as the only thing behind the cab which is connected is the frame...Hope to be racing at Summit Point in W.V. by the time I turn 80||||reg||
