Z||000102||BAM-BAM||03-12-2000||01:10 AM||||   Hey Y'all, My name is Don Bartlett, 38 years old, Utility Electrician, you know the guy that correct the engineers mistakes <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I have five children two in college, one is a starting cornerback for Southern Utah University in the DI-AA. He'll be the next white corner in the NFL <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> Proud of him!!<BR> My next oldest is studying to be an architect at UNLV <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> The others are still in the building years. The brood resides here in Las Vegas and we are headed up by a beutiful red head who is the love of my life(right behind my fiero)HEHE!! I own my second Fiero, first was an 84SE, in 84. Now I have an 85GT. Nice ride but could yous a booster kit!||||reg||12
