Z||000105||phillip||03-12-2000||07:45 AM||||phillip,age 40, factory mech. i have an '87 2.5 5sp. that i got because it remined me of my '74 corvette (little bruh and big bruh). i try to find similar pieces for them.fiero has early '80's side scoops for hood scoops, indy pace car scoop(i get more teasing for that than any thing i've done),saleen mustang rear spoiler(pretty much any wing that will fit on a 5.0 type mustang coupe or convertible fits and looks good on a fiero,if i get another with no wing i plan to put an F-40 wing on it),and a switch to a gt exhaust with two huge import boy tips(hey i like em) and free flow cat in hope of a future engine change.waiting for I R M side roker panels i ordered and looking for some kind of front and rear spoilers. i'd like to end up with another eventualy, an original style gt or indy fiero (i don't like the later gt look) or maybe even a convertble.i guess this was more about the car than me but i'm not that interesting anyway. <BR>||||reg||1
