Z||000107||William Federle||03-12-2000||08:37 AM||||As my user name says, I'm William Federle. I am 56, live in Milwaukee Wisconsin and I work at Giddings & Lewis machine tool company in Fond du Lac, Wisconsin. My wife and I have been married 35 years in February. I bought my Fiero last August to avoid piling any more miles on our truck - we want to use it to pull a trailer around the USA when we retire. Most of my spare time now is devoted to keeping the Fiero running and fixing all of the little things wrong with it. It's changed from an attempt to keep a piece of transportation running to a labor of love though. I can't imagine ever getting rid of my 1984 black Fiero SE.<p>[This message has been edited by William Federle (edited 03-12-2000).]||||reg||1
