Z||000112||b_b_a_d||03-13-2000||06:53 AM||||Brian Karr from beautiful sunny California relocated to the Great NorthWest for the past 10 years now.  Puget Sound, Washington.<P>Currently working for Boeing...  (don't hold your breath on this one)  LOL!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>86 Fiero SE Automatic...  My love, my life, my wife driving away in it.  DOH!!!  <P>Picked it up for $1000 cash with only 85000 miles on it!  I sent a rod thru the block and oil pan 7 months later when I was seeing what she could really do!  Guys/Girls...  Don't downshift to 1st in an Automatic when coming off the HWY doing 90 mph!  Don't ask!!!  Just know that is was a short landing strip and I had to put the flaps down in a hurry!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
